  "notes": "candidate=1, unmeasured (re-measure required, 2026-11-18). Bases, side pads, routes and per-building pads moved (2026-11-18) to the S006 example's Unity-measured legal positions (Tools/Missions/examples/s006-desert-base-ba-combined-established.json, legal candidates from lane4-dump-S002, post spawn fixes 5e1eb1b9c..29dc2818b): the earlier copy (a70de70f9) kept the illegal enemy HQ [1387.8,650]/highway staging and had no instance_pads, the cause of the S007 lane20 BlockedSpawn. Instance pads (Field roster, 7 per side) are ordered like SkirmishSetupCompiler.BuildStructures so each building takes the pad measured for its own footprint; the defender towers use their defense.approach.a/b role pads. Desert Base host geometry only (air.* dropped: Ground Maneuver). structure_footprints copied from the S006 example. S019 Convoy Escort: the three bays keep their rule (thirds of the spawn.vehicle.player pad along the layout's forward axis, each 4.6 wide, so they do not overlap in the layout frame) and therefore move with that pad to [926.0,651.5] 14x12 (old pad partly blocked: 2cc13ab02); the frame now runs player base -> relocated enemy base, so the thirds lie on that axis instead of world X. Destination unchanged as literal coordinates [1308.36,621.2]..[1352.05,650.0] (originally old rally.enemy..staging.enemy x, service.enemy..staging.enemy z). Towers as S013: defense.approach.a/b moved minimally to the nearest clear 3x4 tower origins (pad_preflight on lane4-dump-S002: the old centres on ruins.far/sweep.east had no clear origin inside the 10x10 pad, scenery/road): a [1340.14,706.0]->[1340.5,702.0] (4.0 m, origin 1339,700), b [1316.31,598.8]->[1310.5,610.0] (12.6 m, origin 1309,608), beside the north/south flank routes; pad [10,10]. All three routes are vehicle routes with different middle waypoints; bay/tower sizes are hypotheses until measured. Needs area_measurement before check_draft passes.",
